  "statement": "Let \\(r_{1}, r_{2}, r_{3}, r_{4}\\) be the four roots of the polynomial \\(x^{4}-4 x^{3}+8 x^{2}-7 x+3\\). Find the value of\n\n\\[\\frac{r_{1}^{2}}{r_{2}^{2}+r_{3}^{2}+r_{4}^{2}}+\\frac{r_{2}^{2}}{r_{1}^{2}+r_{3}^{2}+r_{4}^{2}}+\\frac{r_{3}^{2}}{r_{1}^{2}+r_{2}^{2}+r_{4}^{2}}+\\frac{r_{4}^{2}}{r_{1}^{2}+r_{2}^{2}+r_{3}^{2}}\\]",
  "answerChoices": [],
  "answer": {
    "letter": null,
    "value": null
  },
